  "decision": "#340",
  "summary": [
    "T1 real native-launcher keyboard matrix passes in a headless app with private file custody and zero windows.",
    "Nine real-PTY cases: zsh, Claude fixture and Codex fixture, each at tab/right/down; every starting frame is admitted frame +1.",
    "Each correlated real seat retains the starting rectangle; PID/tty, nonce input, shared-pool uniqueness, explicit name override and PNG assertions pass.",
    "Starting operations carry no provisional seat identity, key or grant; expiry/dismissal and immediate-reply cases are covered by pure state and wire tests.",
    "Existing split arithmetic is shared for real seat and operation leaves; settled scenes retain the existing seat path.",
    "CLI seat ls reads exact retained GUI rows and operation rows; Client.seats retains its existing bare-session lane.",
    "Two bare-Session ctl fixtures now authenticate their GUI owner and answer the actual metadata relay; assertions retained.",
    "An extra held-companion assertion failed because it wrongly required starting state until harness readiness; removed as contrary to #340, not by changing product limits.",
    "No real model, API, photon/scanout or native-window claim; deterministic harness executables are real PTY processes for T1, not L4 model evidence.",
    "No postsubmit acceptance claimed before the author landing.",
    "The shared shell seat_field consumer is red on a mixed real/starting listing before the compatibility fix, green after it."
  ],
  "mechanisms": {
    "crates/bboxy450-term/src/starting.rs:13": "operation leaves and real SeatId leaves have distinct types",
    "crates/bboxy450-term/src/starting.rs:105": "bounded admission chooses the shared-pool name and captures placement",
    "crates/bboxy450-term/src/starting.rs:325": "first receipt records an actually produced frame and its solved bounds",
    "crates/bboxy450-term/src/app_starting.rs:134": "native and headless produced-frame owners use the same transition",
    "crates/bboxy450-term/src/app_starting.rs:194": "metadata read leaves the active UI waiter intact",
    "crates/bboxy450-term/src/scene/starting.rs:40": "projection and rows are keyed by operation, without inventing authoritative seats",
    "crates/bbt-ui-model/src/layout/split.rs:28": "unchanged split arithmetic, generic leaf identity",
    "scripts/e2e/t1_launch.py:52": "script checks real launcher actions, PTYs, input, names, placement and first-frame receipts"
  },
